ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T11:27:37Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T11:27:37Z","body":"Yeah good question. I imagine it should work like this:\r\n```js\r\n// stops the entire handler from having an effect\r\n// event.stopPropagation() isn't called anyway\r\nevent.preventBaseUIHandler();\r\n\r\n// *only* prevents event.stopPropagation() from being called\r\n// but the logic still executes\r\nevent.preventBaseUIHandler({\r\n  preventStopPropagation: true,\r\n});\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3196259814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3196295986","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/2382#issuecomment-3196295986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2382","id":3196295986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6-g5sy","user":{"login":"vladmoroz","id":8441036,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDEwMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8441036?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz","html_url":"https://github.com/vladmoroz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T11:39:44Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T11:39:44Z","body":"Are there any other configuration things to prevent?\r\n\r\nSomething like this came to my mind\r\n```js\r\nevent.configure({\r\n  dismissDialog: true,\r\n  preventDefault: false,\r\n  stopPropagation: false,\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\njust spitballing though","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3196295986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3196305182","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/2382#issuecomment-3196305182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2382","id":3196305182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6-g78e","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T11:42:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T11:42:28Z","body":"`preventPreventDefault` is awkward yeah 😬 \r\n\r\nMaybe `allowPreventDefault` / `allowStopPropagation`\r\n\r\nSince this is meant to be generic for all events/components, we shouldn't make anything too specific. The `reason` strings per component should be enough to have control aside from this?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3196305182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3196309970","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/2382#issuecomment-3196309970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2382","id":3196309970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6-g9HS","user":{"login":"vladmoroz","id":8441036,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDEwMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8441036?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz","html_url":"https://github.com/vladmoroz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vla